---
layout: base.njk
title: About
---
<main class="wrap">
  <section class="content-block">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>Three worlds, <em>one lens.</em></h1>
    <p>I'm a photographer based in Johor, Malaysia, working across sports, weddings, and events. Whatever the setting, the job is the same — read the room, anticipate the moment, and be in position before it happens.</p>
    <p>Match days taught me to shoot fast and trust instinct. Weddings taught me patience and how to disappear into a room. Corporate events taught me to find a real moment inside a scheduled one. All three feed each other.</p>

    <div class="stat-row">
      <div class="stat"><b>120+</b><span>Weddings Shot</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><b>7 Yrs</b><span>Behind the Camera</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><b>50+</b><span>Match Days Covered</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="contact-block" id="contact">
    <p class="eyebrow">Get in touch</p>
    <h2 class="section-title" style="margin-top:14px;">Let's book a <em>shoot.</em></h2>
    <form onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); this.querySelector('.submit-btn').textContent='Sent — Thank You';">
      <div>
        <label for="name">Name</label>
        <input id="name" type="text" placeholder="Your name" required>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label for="email">Email</label>
        <input id="email" type="email" placeholder="you@email.com" required>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label for="details">What are you booking?</label>
        <textarea id="details" placeholder="Sports coverage, wedding, event — date and details"></textarea>
      </div>
      <button class="submit-btn" type="submit">Send Inquiry</button>
    </form>
  </section>
</main>
